SUMMARY:John Caparulo LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJohn Caparulo is a beloved stand-up comedian known for his relatable\, self-deprecating humor and everyman charm that resonates with audiences across the country. \nHe gained national recognition through his appearances on Chelsea Lately\, The Tonight Show\, and his own Comedy Central special\, building a loyal fanbase with his honest\, blue-collar comedic perspective. \nCaparulo’s comedy is warm\, accessible\, and consistently hilarious — drawing on his experiences as a husband\, father\, and regular guy navigating the absurdities of modern life. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Tuesday\, July 14\, 2026\nShow Time: 9:30 PM (doors open earlier)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: From $49\n\nAbout the Venue\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is one of the premier comedy destinations on the Las Vegas Strip\, located on the iconic LINQ Promenade at 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nThe intimate venue seats approximately 300 guests and features a state-of-the-art sound system\, excellent sightlines from every seat\, and full bar service throughout the show. \nThe club’s cozy atmosphere creates an up-close-and-personal comedy experience unlike the large arena shows Vegas is known for. Parking is available at the LINQ Hotel parking garage\, and the venue is easily accessible via the Las Vegas Monorail. \nThe LINQ Promenade itself offers a variety of dining and entertainment options before and after the show\, making it a perfect evening destination on the Strip. \nWhat to Expect\nJohn Caparulo delivers a headline solo stand-up performance filled with his trademark self-deprecating humor\, relatable family stories\, and sharp observational comedy. \nExpect a warm\, laugh-out-loud show where Caparulo’s natural likability and comedic timing create an effortlessly entertaining evening. His sets feel like hanging out with a funny friend who happens to be a professional comedian. \nThis is a perfect show for fans of clean\, accessible comedy in an intimate Las Vegas club setting. Arrive early to grab a drink and enjoy the full experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $49 and are available through official and resale channels. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/john-caparulo-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club-2/
LOCATION:Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
