SUMMARY:Vicki Barbolak LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nVicki Barbolak LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\nAmerica’s Got Talent fan favorite Vicki Barbolak brings her hilarious Trailer Park Happy Hour show to Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club at the LINQ on the Las Vegas Strip on July 15\, 2026. Known for her outrageous humor and lovable personality\, Vicki delivers a night of laughs you won’t forget. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PT\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109 (at the LINQ)\nAge Requirement: 18+ (except Farrell Dillon shows which are all ages)\nParking: Available at Harrah’s\, Flamingo\, LINQ\, and surface lots \nAbout Vicki Barbolak\nVicki Barbolak is a Top 10 finalist and fan favorite from NBC’s America’s Got Talent\, where Simon Cowell called her “the best comedian we’ve had on this show.” She’s a member of Jay Leno’s NBC Laugh Squad\, won Funniest Mom in America on Nick@Nite\, and hosts the hit podcast Trailer Park Diaries produced by Bill Burr. Her comedy is bold\, warm\, and wildly funny. \nWhat to Expect\n\nVicki Barbolak’s signature Trailer Park Happy Hour show\nBold\, outrageous stand-up comedy\n18+ show at Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club on the Strip\nAs seen on America’s Got Talent and America’s Got Talent: The Champions\nIntimate venue with great sightlines\nUp to 3 hours free parking for locals nearby\n\nVenue Information\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is located at the LINQ Promenade on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering an intimate 18+ comedy experience with top national headliners nightly. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $62. This event has a 20-ticket limit. Must be 18+ to attend. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/vicki-barbolak-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club/
