SUMMARY:Conor Janda LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Conor Janda\nConor Janda is a rising stand-up comedian known for his clever\, observational humor and engaging storytelling. His comedy draws from everyday life experiences\, delivered with a sharp wit and a conversational style that instantly connects with audiences. \nHe has built a loyal following through his relatable material and consistent performances at clubs and festivals across the country. Fans can expect a tight\, well-crafted set full of laughs and clever observations. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is one of the most beloved comedy venues in Northern California. Located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, this intimate club has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe venue features a cozy\, club-style layout with general admission and preferred seating options\, a full bar\, and the classic two-drink minimum. Every seat offers a great view of the stage\, and the warm atmosphere makes for a perfect night out. Parking is available in the surrounding shopping center lot. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline stand-up performance by Conor Janda. Additional shows are available July 16–17\, so check for your preferred date and time. Expect an evening of sharp\, engaging comedy in an intimate club setting. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $28 – $46 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/conor-janda-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, California\, 95825\, United States Of America
