SUMMARY:"Weird Al" Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LIVE at Mohegan Sun Arena
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \n“Weird Al” Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LIVE at Mohegan Sun Arena\nThe legendary “Weird Al” Yankovic brings his spectacular Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour to Mohegan Sun Arena in Uncasville\, CT on July 15\, 2026. The undisputed king of comedy music returns with an extravagant live show featuring his greatest parody hits\, original songs\, and jaw-dropping costume changes — one night after his Providence show! \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Mohegan Sun Arena\nAddress: 1 Mohegan Sun Blvd\, Uncasville\, CT 06382\nAge Requirement: All Ages\nTicket Prices: Starting at $81 \nAbout “Weird Al” Yankovic\n“Weird Al” Yankovic is the best-selling comedy recording artist of all time\, with 5 Grammy Awards and over 12 million albums sold worldwide. Known for iconic parodies like “Eat It\,” “Amish Paradise\,” and “White & Nerdy\,” Weird Al has been entertaining audiences for over four decades. His 2022 biopic “Weird: The Al Yankovic Story” introduced him to a whole new generation of fans. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA spectacular full-production live show with elaborate costumes\nClassic parody hits and beloved original songs\nMultiple costume changes and theatrical set pieces\nAll-ages family-friendly entertainment\nOne of the most unique and entertaining live shows in music and comedy\nA night of pure joy and laughter at the world-famous Mohegan Sun Arena\n\nVenue Information\nMohegan Sun Arena is one of the premier entertainment venues in New England\, located at 1 Mohegan Sun Blvd in Uncasville\, CT. The 10\,000-seat arena is part of the world-famous Mohegan Sun resort complex and offers free parking\, excellent sightlines\, and a world-class entertainment experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $81 and are available now. This is an all-ages event. There is an overall 4 ticket limit for this event. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/weird-al-yankovic-bigger-weirder-tour-live-at-mohegan-sun-arena/
