SUMMARY:Gabriel Iglesias: Fluffy's 50th Birthday Show LIVE at Dolby Theatre
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nGabriel Iglesias: Fluffy’s 50th Birthday Show LIVE at Dolby Theatre\nGabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias is celebrating his 50th birthday in the most fitting way possible — with a live comedy show at the iconic Dolby Theatre in Hollywood. \nAll tickets are priced at a flat $50 for this one-night-only birthday celebration on his actual birthday\, July 15\, 2026. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM PDT \nVenue: Dolby Theatre \nAddress: 6801 Hollywood Blvd\, Hollywood\, CA 90028 \nAge Requirement: All ages welcome \nAbout Gabriel Iglesias\nGabriel Iglesias\, known worldwide as “Fluffy\,” is one of the most successful stand-up comedians in the world. He has sold out arenas across the globe and starred in multiple Netflix specials\, including One Show Fits All and Stadium Fluffy. \nKnown for his high-energy storytelling\, hilarious character voices\, and relatable humor\, Fluffy has built a massive fanbase spanning generations. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA one-night-only 50th birthday celebration with Gabriel Iglesias\nHilarious stand-up comedy featuring Fluffy’s signature storytelling style\nSpecial birthday surprises and moments throughout the show\nAn intimate evening at the legendary Dolby Theatre in Hollywood\nFlat $50 all-in ticket pricing — a rare deal for a major comedy event\n\nVenue Information\nThe Dolby Theatre is one of Hollywood’s most prestigious venues\, located at 6801 Hollywood Blvd. Home to the Academy Awards\, it offers world-class acoustics and an unforgettable atmosphere for live performances. \nTicket Information\nAll tickets are $50 (all-in pricing). This is a special flat-rate birthday show — no tiered pricing. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
