SUMMARY:Chinedu Unaka LIVE at San Jose Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nChinedu Unaka is a Los Angeles-based stand-up comedian\, actor\, and writer who has quickly become one of the most exciting voices in comedy today. \nHe has been featured on Don’t Tell Comedy\, Comedy Central Presents\, and the Arsenio Hall Show (Netflix is a Joke). His acting credits include guest roles on hit TV shows like Abbott Elementary and Insecure\, as well as the feature film House Party. \nHis debut comedy album “Mostly Kidding” debuted at #1 on iTunes\, and he co-hosts the award-winning podcast “Nosy Neighbors.” Timeout LA recognized him as “A Comic to Watch\,” and he has toured globally alongside comedy heavyweights including Damon Wayans\, Marlon Wayans\, Damon Wayans Jr.\, and Yvonne Orji. \nBorn and raised in Los Angeles\, Chinedu started doing stand-up while studying at UCSB. He later earned a Master’s in Education from Loyola Marymount and worked as a public school special education teacher before pursuing comedy full-time. His smooth delivery and engaging style make him a crowd favorite wherever he performs. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026\nShow Time: 8:00 PM PDT\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM PDT\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event — Valid ID required at entry\nTwo-Item Minimum: All guests must purchase a minimum of two food/beverage items in the showroom\nNo Photography or Recording: Cell phone use\, photography\, and video recording are not permitted during the performance\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe San Jose Improv is one of the Bay Area’s most beloved comedy clubs\, nestled in the heart of downtown San Jose at 62 S Second St. \nAs part of the nationally recognized Improv Comedy Club chain\, the San Jose Improv delivers an intimate\, club-style experience where the stage feels just steps away. The venue offers general admission seating on a first-come\, first-served basis\, with premium banquette and booth options available for groups seeking a more exclusive experience. \nThe showroom buzzes with energy from the moment doors open\, with full food and cocktail service available throughout the evening. The venue is conveniently located near downtown San Jose parking garages and is accessible via public transit. The mandatory two-item minimum ensures every guest enjoys a complete dinner-and-show experience. \nWhat to Expect\nChinedu Unaka is celebrated for his smooth\, conversational delivery and his ability to connect with audiences through relatable\, observational humor. \nExpect a night of sharp\, engaging stand-up that blends personal storytelling with clever social commentary. Chinedu’s background as a former teacher gives his comedy a unique warmth and intelligence — he knows how to read a room and keep the energy high from start to finish. \nThis is a 21+ event in an intimate club setting\, perfect for a date night or a fun evening out with friends. Arrive early to grab the best seats\, as seating is general admission. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Chinedu Unaka at San Jose Improv start at $25 (GA)\, with Premium Banquette options available up to $75 per ticket (including fees). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chinedu-unaka-live-at-san-jose-improv/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\, United States
