DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nElliott Brothers’ Comedy Block Party Hosted by Chris Spencer LIVE at The Miracle Theater\nThe Elliott Brothers and Chris Spencer bring Comedy Block Party back to Downtown Inglewood at the legendary Miracle Theater on July 15\, 2026. \nJoin host Chris Spencer and his all-star lineup of friends for the coolest Block Party in town! \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026 \nDoors: 7:00 PM PDT \nShow Time: 8:30 PM PDT \nVenue: The Miracle Theater \nAddress: 226 Market St\, Inglewood\, CA 90301 \nNote: Prices increase on the Day of Show. Tickets for admission only. Drinks may be purchased at the bar. \nAbout Elliott Brothers’ Comedy Block Party\nElliott Brothers Entertainment presents Comedy Block Party\, a celebrated stand-up comedy showcase hosted by actor and comedian Chris Spencer. \nThe show brings together some of the funniest voices in comedy for an unforgettable evening of laughs in the heart of Inglewood. \nWhat to Expect\n\nAll-star stand-up comedy showcase hosted by Chris Spencer\nMultiple comedians performing throughout the night\nHigh-energy crowd and electric atmosphere in Downtown Inglewood\nIntimate venue setting at The Miracle Theater\nOne of the hottest recurring comedy events in Los Angeles\n\nVenue Information\nThe Miracle Theater is located at 226 Market St in Downtown Inglewood\, CA\, just minutes from SoFi Stadium and Intuit Dome. \nIt is a premier entertainment destination known for world-class comedy shows and live events in the greater Los Angeles area. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $30. Note: Prices increase on the Day of Show — buy early to save! \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost 