SUMMARY:Zach Rushing: The Redneck Logic Tour LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nZach Rushing is a Mississippi-born comedian who has built a loyal following by being unapologetically himself. Known for his sharp wit\, Southern charm\, and relatable storytelling\, Zach brings a refreshing authenticity to the stage that resonates with audiences across the country. \nHe rose to prominence through his viral social media presence and his popular Not-So-Rich-And-Famous Tour\, where he delivered honest\, hilarious takes on everyday life\, pop culture\, and the Southern experience. His comedy is rooted in real life — the kind of humor that makes you laugh because it hits a little too close to home. \nBeyond comedy\, Zach is the owner and CEO of Triple B Outdoors\, a brand built around his love for hunting\, fishing\, and the great outdoors. His genuine passion for the simple things in life makes him a uniquely inspiring and entertaining performer in today’s comedy landscape. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 16\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 5:30 PM) \nVenue: Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC 27519 \nTicket Prices: $45.73 – $153.25 \nAge Restrictions: This is a comedy club show — guests under 21 must be accompanied by a parent or guardian. Please check with the venue for specific policies. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is one of the Triangle area’s premier comedy destinations\, located at 1224 Parkside Main St in Cary\, NC — just minutes from downtown Raleigh. Part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, the Raleigh Improv has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy. \nThe venue features a classic comedy club layout with tiered seating\, ensuring great sightlines from virtually every seat in the house. The intimate atmosphere creates a personal connection between the performer and the audience that larger arenas simply can’t replicate. \nThe Raleigh Improv also offers a full food and beverage menu\, so guests can enjoy dinner and drinks while taking in the show. Parking is available in the surrounding Parkside Town Commons shopping center. The venue is easily accessible from I-40 and US-1\, making it convenient for guests coming from Raleigh\, Durham\, Chapel Hill\, and surrounding areas. \nWhat to Expect\nZach Rushing’s Redneck Logic Tour promises an evening of high-energy\, laugh-out-loud stand-up comedy. Expect Zach’s signature blend of Southern storytelling\, self-deprecating humor\, and sharp observations about life\, culture\, and the outdoors. \nThis is a solo headlining show\, so fans will get a full set from Zach himself. His performances are known for being interactive and energetic — he feeds off the crowd and delivers a show that feels personal and spontaneous every single night. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or discovering Zach Rushing for the first time\, this is a night of comedy you won’t want to miss. Arrive early to grab a good seat and enjoy dinner before the show kicks off. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $45.73 – $153.25 \nTickets are available through official channels and resale platforms. Grab your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/zach-rushing-the-redneck-logic-tour-live-at-raleigh-improv/
LOCATION:Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC\, 27519\, United States Of America
