SUMMARY:Joey Avery LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJoey Avery is a standout stand-up comedian celebrated for his sharp wit\, magnetic stage presence\, and ability to connect with audiences through honest\, hilarious storytelling. His comedy draws from real-life experiences\, delivering laughs with a warmth and authenticity that keeps crowds coming back for more. \nAvery recently released his debut comedy special Live in San Francisco\, which was met with widespread acclaim and introduced him to a national audience. His material is clever\, well-crafted\, and delivered with the kind of confident ease that only comes from years of honing his craft on stages across the country. \nCatching Joey Avery live is a treat — his shows are energetic\, personal\, and packed with the kind of comedy that leaves you quoting lines on the drive home. Don’t miss your chance to see him at one of San Francisco’s premier comedy clubs. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 16\, 2026 (also Fri July 17 & Sat July 18)\nTime: 8:00 PM PDT (Thu) | 7:30 PM & 9:45 PM (Fri) | 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM (Sat)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $32 – $52 \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco is one of the most legendary comedy venues in the country\, located at 444 Battery Street in the heart of the Financial District. Since opening in 1978\, Punch Line has been the launching pad for some of the biggest names in comedy\, including Robin Williams\, Ellen DeGeneres\, and Jerry Seinfeld. \nThe club seats approximately 300 guests in a cozy\, table-and-chair setup that creates an intimate atmosphere perfect for stand-up comedy. A full bar and food menu are available throughout the show\, and the staff is known for their attentive\, friendly service. \nThe venue is conveniently located near public transit and within walking distance of several parking garages. Whether you’re a first-time visitor or a regular\, Punch Line delivers a world-class comedy experience every single night. \nWhat to Expect\nJoey Avery performs multiple shows across the weekend of July 16–18\, giving you several opportunities to catch this rising star live. Each show is a full stand-up set featuring his best material\, delivered with the energy and precision that has made him one of the most talked-about comedians on the circuit. \nThe 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effect for all shows. Doors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime — arrive early to secure a great seat and enjoy a pre-show drink. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $32 – $52 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/joey-avery-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-san-francisco/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, California\, 94111\, United States Of America
