SUMMARY:Andrew Dismukes LIVE at Punch Line Philly
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Andrew Dismukes\nAndrew Dismukes is one of the most exciting comedians to emerge from the Saturday Night Live universe in recent years. A cast member on NBC’s SNL since Season 46\, Dismukes first joined the show as a writer in Season 43\, earning Emmy nominations for Outstanding Writing for a Variety Series in 2018 and 2019 before stepping in front of the camera as a featured player and later a repertory cast member. \nBefore SNL\, Dismukes honed his stand-up chops at the University of Texas at Austin\, where he was the runner-up in the “Funniest Person in Austin” contest in 2016. His stand-up style is sharp\, clever\, and deeply personal — blending absurdist observations with self-aware humor that showcases the same comedic instincts that made him a standout on one of television’s most demanding stages. Seeing Dismukes perform live stand-up is a rare treat for fans who know him from TV. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 17\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open approximately 30 minutes before showtime) \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restriction: 21+ event with a 2-drink minimum \nTicket Prices: $32 – $72 (plus fees) \nAbout Punch Line Philly\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located at 33 E. Laurel Street in the vibrant Northern Liberties neighborhood. The intimate venue seats approximately 300 guests and is purpose-built to deliver the best possible comedy experience — every seat is close to the stage\, and the energy in the room is electric from the moment the lights go down. \nThe club features a full bar and food service\, with a 2-drink minimum per guest. The layout ensures excellent sightlines from every seat\, and the warm\, lively atmosphere makes Punch Line Philly the ideal setting for a world-class stand-up show. The venue has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and remains Philadelphia’s top destination for live laughs. \nParking is available in nearby lots and on surrounding streets. The venue is also accessible via SEPTA public transportation. Arrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy a drink before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nAndrew Dismukes live is a treat for comedy fans of all kinds. Whether you’ve followed his work on SNL or are discovering him for the first time\, his stand-up set delivers the same sharp wit and comedic precision that has made him one of television’s most beloved performers. Expect clever material\, great timing\, and the kind of performance that reminds you why live comedy is so special. \nThis is a Friday night show — the perfect way to kick off the weekend with serious laughs. The intimate Punch Line Philly setting means you’ll be up close with one of comedy’s brightest rising stars. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $32 – $72 (plus applicable fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Andrew Dismukes shows sell out fast — grab your seats now! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-philly/
